Integration risks (see final report): NULL-stream capture illegality (exec_
plumbing), synchronous cudaMemcpy/cudaMemset and cudaEventQuery/Synchronize
must never run inside an armed span (fragments start after staging, expert
region + finite-check stay eager), pageable H2D absent (all staging buffers
are cudaHostAlloc'd), first-use cudaMallocs (arena/try_pin/f32_cache)
require one eager warmup round per shape before arming, and
cudaStreamCaptureModeThreaded confines restrictions to the decode thread
(reader-pool threads make no CUDA calls).
